stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> in_tree: add (new id, v1)
    in_tree --> in_tree: edit label, description or aphia_id<br/>move, children set changed<br/>→ new node version
    in_tree --> deprecated: deprecate at rev r<br/>(requires no children)<br/>successors optional
    deprecated --> [*]

    note right of deprecated
        last version closed at rev r (no new version)
        deprecated_in_rev = r, successors set on the node
        still shown at revisions before r
        absent from the tree at r and later
        lookup by id returns the deprecation record
        id never reused; old ROIs keep pointing here
    end note
